# Repo housekeeping, not part of the published site.
.git
.gitignore
.assetsignore
wrangler.toml
README.md
NOTICE
tools
# docs/ holds the README's images; docs/api.html is a published page (the
# desktop app links to /docs/api), so only the images are kept out.
docs/*.png
docs/*.jpg
docs/*.gif
docs/*.md
# The Worker's own source is bundled by wrangler; it is not a page.
src
# Local-only: never part of the site, even when deploying from a working copy.
# Secrets kept for `wrangler dev` above all: a deploy from a working copy that
# has one would otherwise publish it at the site's root.
.dev.vars*
.env*
*.local
__pycache__
*.pyc
node_modules
brag-output
.wrangler
# GitHub Actions workflows (IndexNow), never published.
.github
